## Session-end gate

Do not report complete, commit, or advise deploying until:

- [ ] **`python ../lab-standards/management/validate-docs.py --repo .` exits 0**. This replaces hand-checking slugs, enums, `parent_doc`, and secrets
- [ ] Any flow-up trigger fired → **`lab-standards` updated this session**
- [ ] `depends_on` / `depended_on_by` declared **both directions**
- [ ] Any diagnosed/addressed issue → lab `INCIDENT-LOG.md` **and** `docs/incidents/INC-*.md` pointer, written **without asking**
- [ ] Any fix → `TROUBLESHOOTING.md` entry, this session
- [ ] CHANGELOG prepended in **both** repos if both changed
- [ ] **Sync receipt updated** with current `lab-standards` SHA
- [ ] No credentials — reference by `vault://` path only
- [ ] **Conflicts raised, not resolved**

**A two-repo change is one unit of work.** Both commit and push before it is done. Push order: **child repo first, then `lab-standards`** — the lab-wide view must never be ahead of the reality it describes.
